!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ft_merge_summary.md
# D's identifier-completion reports (PubMed DOI/PMID lookups): record_id/title/year/journal/identifiers
# only, no abstracts.
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/identifier_completion_*.csv
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/identifier_completion_*.md
# D's V-layer OA pre-fetch outputs (scripts/fetch_fulltexts_oa.py): status/source/hash/note
# columns only, no full-text content (PDFs live under /fulltexts/, ignored above).
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/fulltext_fetch_manifest.csv
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/fulltext_fetch_summary.md

!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/oa_classification_*.md

