# only, no full-text content; PDFs stay under /fulltexts/, ignored above).
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/oa_fetch2_*.csv
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/oa_fetch2_*.md

# D's full-text scope re-base (2026-10-09): join/diff report and the no-abstract working-scope
