# committed ai_triage/confirmed_V_list_*.csv).
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/scope_rescope_*.md
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ft_scope_*.csv

# PRE-010 AI full-text pre-fill (scripts/ft_prefill_run.py, ft_prefill_to_workbook.py): extracted
# PDF text (V_text/) and raw per-record model runs (ai_prefill/runs/) may quote the full text and
# are never committed; V_text/ is already denied by the "fulltext/*" deny-all above. The ai_prefill/
# directory must be re-included before its own deny-all + allow-list can take effect.
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/
04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/*
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_screen_prompt_v1.md
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_screen_prompt_v1_1.md
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_screen_schema_v1.json
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/run_manifest.json
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_prefill_summary_*.md
# PRE-010 override pass (scripts/ft_override_run.py, reviewer B stand-in, 2026-10-09): prompt,
# extended schema, committable run manifest (no full-text quotes) and summary are tracked; the
# raw per-record runs (ai_prefill/runs/override_sol/*.json, quote the full text) stay ignored by
# the "ai_prefill/*" deny-all above.
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_prompt_v1.md
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_schema_v1.json
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_run_manifest.json
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_B_summary_*.md
# PRE-010 override pass, reviewer C stand-in (2026-10-09, Claude Sonnet headless, effort high):
