# never collide. The raw per-record runs (ai_prefill/runs/override_claude_sonnet/*.json, quote the
# full text) stay ignored by the "ai_prefill/*" deny-all above.
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_prompt_C_v1.md
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_schema_C_v1.json
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/ft_override_C_summary_*.md
# PRE-011 (2026-10-09) age-rule override sidecars (record_id -> old/new disposition + short
# evidence snippet only; no abstracts or full-text quotes; runs/ itself stays ignored above).
!04_screening/formal_*/fulltext/ai_prefill/pre011_overrides_*.json
